1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.962
Tim Hawks:

2
00:00:01.962 --> 00:01:11.428
I want to tell you guys how much I appreciate your support and encouragement with having my wife speak last week. Text messages: Tim, you don't need to come back, send your wife from now on, she knows more about this than you do. We learned a lot. I want to affirm what Cindy said. I'm proud of you for your willingness and desire to grow in masculinity.

3
00:01:11.428 --> 00:01:41.451
Today, second part of the husband-wife relationship. Single guys: you may be married. You need to support your brothers who are married. Don't check out.

4
00:01:41.451 --> 00:03:44.095
The God of the universe who created men and women, masculinity and femininity, has an amazing plan for how marriage works. When we work his plan, it makes life great for everybody. Contrast the world: presidential election, candidates and media, you can't have a three-sentence conversation, only one-sentence sound bites to pick the leader of the free world. That's considered wisdom. People look at the Bible: outdated. Bring back the outdated if current, progressive is what we're seeing. I tell my kids I believe in a devil. How I validate that: smart people could not be so stupid. There's got to be some sinister force.

5
00:03:44.095 --> 00:04:10.783
God's design for marriage is different than current cultural trends. Wisdom of God versus foolish experiments cultures do over and over.

6
00:04:10.783 --> 00:04:52.972
Two weeks ago: two normal models. Top-down traditional: husband ruler, boss, wife serves him, benefits flow up. Authoritarian. A lot of people confuse the biblical model with this. That's not what the Bible teaches.

7
00:04:52.972 --> 00:05:57.924
Second: 50/50 mythical, currently embraced. She takes half, he takes half. What does half mean? Who's really responsible? Anybody looking at the big picture? Chaotic and frustrating. Egalitarian. Premise: if somebody is responsible then they are better. One of Satan's lies, confused with top-down traditional. About getting equal.

8
00:05:57.924 --> 00:07:07.194
Third: biblical view, complementarian. God created masculinity and femininity to complement each other. When men do their part and women do their part, side by side, symbiotic, complementary skills, team: human thriving. Masculinity upheld, encouraged, fostered. Femininity honored, cherished. Children have the best opportunity in a stable environment.

9
00:07:07.194 --> 00:08:55.905
Three things: core roles, core responsibilities, core concerns. Core does not mean comprehensive. Not the only thing a man or woman can do. Essential things they must focus on that fit gender and wiring. When those are focused on, the marriage works, which gives freedom to add other things. Not cookie cutter. Every man has gifts and skill sets. As long as he focuses on the core, the marriage works. Women different gifts and interests. Two couples living this out can look very different. Lots of freedom. If the core is not tended to, problems occur.

10
00:08:55.905 --> 00:10:51.485
Core roles: two circles side by side. Equal value. Different roles. Right: head, husband. Ephesians 5:22: the husband is the head of the wife. Not position or power. Not the place that thinks. Head means direction, setting the direction. Servant leader. Make sure the family has a direction, the big picture is paid attention to, benefits accrued by the family are equally distributed and shared. Not head at the top so benefits flow up. Example of masculinity: Jesus didn't come to build an empire with himself at the top. He came as one who served, provided, gave himself to save others.

11
00:10:51.485 --> 00:14:52.652
Left: helper, wife. Genesis 2:18: it is not good for man to be alone. I will make a helper suitable for him. Helper is an exalted word. Not servant, slave, somebody to do your laundry. Used of all three persons of the Trinity. Helper comes alongside to form a team. Help him do what? Genesis: let us make man in our image, male and female, let them be fruitful and multiply and fill the earth. God-given role: birth, raise, and nurture the next generation. In the 70s we were told the world was overpopulated, good citizens should stop having kids. Japan not capable of sustaining its economic system, zero population growth. Germany bringing in refugees; the prime minister said we do not have enough young Germans being born. United States on the same trajectory. When a country reaches zero population growth it begins to die out in a few generations. We've lost the value of being fruitful. Somebody walks into a restaurant with four kids and people look as if they're weird. That is a valuable part of being human: leave behind children who grow up in a godly way. Benefits: one of the best ways for men to grow up is responsibility for a child. Happiness quotient for those who have kids, study after study, off the charts.

12
00:14:52.652 --> 00:15:53.091
Second: subdue the earth and rule over it. Represent God, build society. Her role is not simply in the kitchen barefoot and pregnant as mischaracterized and taken advantage of by the top-down model. Exalted: work together as a team to do world-changing activities ordained by God. She helps him in that role.

13
00:15:53.091 --> 00:17:45.139
Core responses. Husband to wife: praise and honor. Keep her value and equality in view. One of the most significant ways Satan has deceived women, starting with Eve: if God's put him in the role of the one responsible, I have less value. Responsibility of the person in that role to affirm, value, honor equality. 1 Peter 3:7: husbands, grant her honor as heirs of the gracious gift of life. Her standing before God is the same. Keep reminding her of her value, worth, equality, importance, necessity. It is not good for man to be alone. We need our wives. We need women.

14
00:17:45.139 --> 00:22:06.322
Her response: submit and respect. Ephesians 5:22-23: wives, submit to your husbands as unto the Lord. Vote yes for his leadership. Work with him, help him, encourage him to take responsibility. Alternatives: fight him. When guys find out somebody else is willing to do it: passivity. Garden of Eden. Definition: rejects passivity, accepts responsibility, leads courageously, expects the greater reward. Margaret Mead: the most significant thing every society has to decide is appropriate roles for men. In the absence of men needing to take responsibility they move into passivity. Many women, natural leadership gifts: I'm not going to let you lead. A lot of men: great, I'll watch the game, video games, golf course, gym. Honey, if you want it, you can have it. Or fight about who decides direction. Biblical model: she is willing to respect, give him what he needs, encouragement, work with him. Submit: arrange your affairs under. As he takes responsibility for leadership and direction, she says I want you in that role. I know you need to be in that role because if you're not I know what happens to your masculinity. I'm going to arrange my affairs in concert with you. Like players with a coach. Employers and employees. Two incredible tasks: raise the next generation and represent God on the planet. Requires cooperation.

15
00:22:06.322 --> 00:23:52.679
She keeps his leadership in view by participating, asking questions. What has traditionally been called nagging in the top-down model is exactly what respect and submission require. Honey, where's this family going? What's our financial plan? How are we going to raise our kids in a godly way? What are we going to do to grow in our relationship? If you hear those and push back, leave me alone, that's an indication you're not taking responsibility. Those questions are respect. Why would I ask if I didn't think you had some kind of answer?

16
00:23:52.679 --> 00:24:03.667
Core concerns. Four major concerns men need; then wives.

17
00:24:03.667 --> 00:26:03.172
Husbands. 1. Companionship. Someone who wants to be with him, grow old together, share some of his interests. Men and women do companionship differently. March Madness, Michigan State, Final Four. You're on the couch. She comes through with laundry. You pat the couch. Come sit with me. She puts down laundry, thinks he wants something, looks at you. You're looking at the TV. You just wanted a companion. She: do you want to talk? You: not unless you comment on the game. I've got a lot of things to do. You're not even looking at me. Women talk face to face. Men sit and observe the world and talk about it.

18
00:26:03.172 --> 00:29:14.496
2. Support. Operation Desert Storm: for every one soldier in combat, seven military personnel behind the lines: medical, supplies, logistics, communications, engineering. World War II: same quality of soldiers waving in victory in France were starving in Stalingrad. Hitler overran his supply lines. Challenge today: both man and woman fully in the day-to-day battle for the almighty dollar, nobody taking care of support for the family. Wounds build up. Nobody tending nurture, care of the relationship, kids, family. A man can go and go as long as he can come home and realize nurture is being taken care of. Dangerous to require both people slugging it out 40, 50, 60 hours a week and think money and things purchased will be valuable. I grew up in 1400 square feet, six people, four kids, two adults, one shower. Unlivable, right? So send both parties out so we can have three baths, everybody separate, own bedroom, vehicle, space, bathroom. Is quality of life improved?

19
00:29:14.496 --> 00:31:46.968
Will Durant on the demise of the Roman Empire: women began to go back into the workforce in droves. Not a problem with women working. When women began to compete with men, they did not pick up the virtues of men but their vices. Rather than men coming home and being recivilized by their wives, wives going out becoming barbarians with the rest of the dog-eat-dog world. I'm not commenting on whether women or men should work outside the home. Is it really possible? Some of you are divorced not because the person was bad or the relationship doomed, but because you developed an unsustainable approach to life. Some of you are headed down that path. Not tending overall health and a sustainable standard of living and pace. Nothing in our culture supports that. Men need that.

20
00:31:46.968 --> 00:35:32.633
3. Admiration. The command is not to wives to love their husbands but to respect them. Men are not so motivated around someone telling me they love me all the time. At the altar she said she loved me. I look in the mirror: who wouldn't love this? What men need: I believe in you. I will follow you. I appreciate your willingness to make hard choices. Your sacrifice sets a tone. Your love for us gives us life. Inspired to work harder, love more, give more, lead better. Challenge: we think love is unconditional but respect must be earned. Husband, love me unconditionally no matter what, whether I gain 50 pounds or quit treating you well. But you've got to earn my respect. Do everything right. Not recognizing that what helps men do the right thing is being granted respect. Wives, respect your husbands. Not when they earn it. Same as husbands, love your wives, not when they've earned it. If your wife is in Rethinking Womanhood, she's being encouraged that way. If not, get the CDs, put them under her pillow. Single guys figuring out who the girl is: pass them out. If she comes back, I don't agree with any of that, save me 25 years of pain.

21
00:35:32.633 --> 00:36:25.615
4. Physical responsiveness. Sex. She responds in a way that opens the door to a good, healthy sexual relationship. The Bible views sex as a great thing within marriage. God loves it, applauds it. Whole lecture coming on sex. Men emotionally bond through sexual intimacy.

22
00:36:25.615 --> 00:37:22.718
Wives. Valentine card: if you love something, set it free. If it returns, it is truly yours. If it disappears, it was never truly yours. Inside: fat guy, beer, chips, remote, bathrobe. If it just sits there watching television unaware that it has been set free, then you probably married it.

23
00:37:22.718 --> 00:38:52.199
1. Companionship, different type. She wants to know you and be known by you. Biggest complaint, 95 percent: he never talks to me. Women face to face, men side to side, men more task oriented. We defraud women. Most men invest that time in courtship. She falls in love because you listen, get to know her, disclose. Once sealed, tendency to get busy and never spend time. You want shoulder-to-shoulder. She needs the kind of companionship that nurtures her.

24
00:38:52.199 --> 00:42:03.720
2. Security. She needs to know her man is taking care of her. Two ways. Where are we going as a family? Plan the future, give clarity. Last thing she wants: I just took a job in Buffalo. Kids in school. Yeah they got schools in Buffalo. Started talking a year ago, didn't want to worry you. Leaving in about a month. You've set in motion distrust that will last the rest of your life. If you have no idea, she needs to know that too. Second: financial security. A plan to take care of her. Can include some of her income. Caution: a woman's primary wiring is nurture. Multiple degrees, fantastic career, but if a child has special needs, huge pull. If her mother gets cancer, huge pull. Lifestyle where that's not possible: can't make the Hummer payment unless she keeps her job. Deep resentment, usually as worry. Child having trouble, I need to be there, I can't, bills. Work with your spouse on a financial plan with flexibility so if she's needed to nurture, you can flex.

25
00:42:03.720 --> 00:45:15.437
3. Significance. 1 Peter 3: grant her honor. Few things praise a woman for family-related activities. All kinds of rewards for non-family activities. If you're going to assume leadership, make sure she feels her value every single day. Survey: ten job benefits. Managers ranked what they thought employees wanted. Employees ranked. Money: employees third, management first. Not that far apart. What employees put first: recognition and respect for their work. Managers ranked that dead last. In the responsibility role you focus on the task and lose sight of the team. Temptation: as long as I buy her things, keep moving up socioeconomic, she's got to be happy. A woman is often willing to settle for a lot less on the amenity side when married to a man who values her as a person. Praise her publicly. Proverbs: her husband and children call her blessed. Her husband praises her in the city gates, where business is transacted, male leadership sitting in judgment. Huge deal.

26
00:45:15.437 --> 00:47:18.670
4. Emotional responsiveness. Husband needs physical; wife needs emotional. She needs us to feel her pain. We like to solve her problems. Three sentences in, here's what you do about that, honey. Insulted her intelligence. She already knows. She's asking someone to listen, enter in, be emotionally connected. Often emotional responsiveness to a woman is as invigorating as sex is to a man. They tend to go together. Husbands willing to emotionally connect often have a lot more physical connection. Connect by listening. Utter the fearful worst words that come out of a male's mouth: Honey, tell me more about it. Then strap in.

27
00:47:18.670 --> 00:48:48.347
Application: know your customer. Books: James Dobson, Willard Harley, Tim Keller The Meaning of Marriage, Emerson Eggerichs Love and Respect. Tip: go buy a book on marriage. Let your wife catch you reading it. Don't say we need to read a book together, would you go buy it. It sits on the nightstand. Buy it. When she asks why you're reading that: honey I just want to get to know you better. You may have sex that night. What's attractive is that you care.

28
00:48:48.347 --> 00:48:56.000
Discussion groups. Nate, you coming up?

